{"id":"4a1d989a5f615933","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-conservative-truth.md","title":"保守真理理论","display":"df-conservative-truth — 保守真理理论","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-conservative-truth","aliases":["91-df-conservative-truth"],"display":"df-conservative-truth — 保守真理理论","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-conservative-truth"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-conservative-truth</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-conservative-truth — 保守真理理论"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-conservative-truth-—-保守真理理论-$\\mathrm{ConservTh}$\">df-conservative-truth — 保守真理理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConservTh}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConservTh}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{T}_T\">\\(\\mathcal{T}_T\\)</span> (真理理论, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathcal T_T\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathcal T_T\\)</span> (共同基础语言上的子理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0=\\operatorname{Lang}(S)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Lang}(\\mathcal T_T)\">\\(\\mathcal L_0=\\operatorname{Lang}(S)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Lang}(\\mathcal T_T)\\)</span>\n(比较后果所用的基础语言)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal T_T,S)\n\\coloneqq\nS\\subseteq\\mathcal T_T\n\\land \\mathcal L_0=\\operatorname{Lang}(S)\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\varphi\\to S\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal T_T,S)\n\\coloneqq\nS\\subseteq\\mathcal T_T\n\\land \\mathcal L_0=\\operatorname{Lang}(S)\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\varphi\\to S\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConservTh}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConservTh}\\)</span> : 保守性谓词</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span> : 可推导关系</li>\n</ul>\n<p>说明：保守性总是相对于指定子语言与指定基础理论。标准 TB、UTB 以及\n不含扩展语言归纳的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 对 PA 算术保守；这并不是“有类型”分类自动保证的。TB、UTB 本身包含完整真理语言归纳且仍保守；CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span> 加完整归纳得到 CT 则非保守。\n原书“无类型”采用 Definition 10.1 的理论判据，不等同于语言能写自应用句，也不单独决定算术强度。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.5、Theorem 8.5、Definition 10.1；此处的保守性是共同旧语言的通常定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-conservative-truth-—-保守真理理论-$\\mathrm{ConservTh}$","text":"df-conservative-truth — 保守真理理论 $\\mathrm{ConservTh}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{T}_T$ (真理理论, see [[91-df-truth-theory]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConservTh}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{T}_T","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathcal T_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0=\\operatorname{Lang}(S)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Lang}(\\mathcal T_T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal T_T,S)\n\\coloneqq\nS\\subseteq\\mathcal T_T\n\\land \\mathcal L_0=\\operatorname{Lang}(S)\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\\varphi\\to S\\vdash\\varphi\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConservTh}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"^-","display":false}],"bytes":1600,"backlinks":[{"id":"e55a4d03b99a537e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"23ed499f8d7c6524","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(U,S)$ 采用 [[91-df-conservative-truth]] 的旧语言后果保守性。"},{"id":"3d4231874a161ab6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"219433ea709d592f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f32c7d95792dcee2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1bd72595481bc91b","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7e76f1ecb9ab7743","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6f3411be790eb1c9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"acbd9c4756abbc20","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}$ 为基础